  "holistic_F_N": 0,
  "holistic_F_H": 0,
  "section_notes": "The final rules adopt strict S1 reporting and a 5% S2 thermal-test limit with per-model results to customers/regulators but no public publication and no automatic sales stop above 5%. S3 sets a 12-month new-unit shut-off deadline and a 6-year retrofit deadline with a feasibility exception requiring notice. S4 requires built-in suppression at 36 months, and S5 retains an 8/100k mandatory recall trigger with prompt notice."
 },
